        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ Thɔɔl kɛnɛ gaatkɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cua ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl joc, kä cua kɛ näk ɛlɔ̱ŋ pääm Gil-bwä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt Thɔɔl cop kɛnɛ gaatkɛ. Kä cukɛ Jo-na-than, kɛnɛ Ä-bi-na-dab, kɛ Mal-ki-cuwa, gaat Thɔɔl näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ko̱r cuɛ bɛ̈c ɛlɔ̱ŋ kä Thɔɔl, kä cua jɛ moc buɔ̱t mi di̱i̱t kɛ bäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ro̱o̱m muɔ̱tdɛ jiöök i̱, “Käni mutdu, kä näk ɣä kɛ jɛ, kɛ ɣöö ci nɛy ti /ka̱n cuɛl thil Kuoth, ti ɣä bi ben yaak ɛ kɛn, ɛ ba̱a̱ lɛ kuëth.” Duundɛ ɣöö /ken ro̱o̱m muɔ̱tdɛ jɛ la̱t. Kɛ ɣöö cɛ dual ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Kɛ kui̱c ɛ mɔ cu Thɔɔl mutdɛ ka̱n kä cuɛ rɔ pi̱em thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ro̱o̱m muɔ̱tdɛ jɛ nɛn i̱ ci Thɔɔl li̱w, cuɛ rɔ pi̱em kä muɔ̱tdɛ bä, kä cuɛ li̱w kɛɛl kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Thɔɔl li̱w, kɛnɛ gaatkɛ da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, kɛ ro̱o̱m muɔ̱tdɛ, amäni nɛɛkɛ diaal, cukɛ li̱w kɛɛl ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl tin te kui̱ lo̱o̱lä kɛnɛ tin te kui̱ yiëër Jɔr-dɛn ɛ nɛn i̱ ɛn ɣöö ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ bar kä ca Thɔɔl kɛnɛ gaatkɛ näk, cukɛ wi̱i̱kiɛn päl, cukɛ rɔ bar. Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ben cieŋ thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ruɔ̱ndɛ, mëë ci ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ben ba nɛy tin ci li̱w ben guic, cu kɛ Thɔɔl kɛnɛ gaatkɛ da̱ŋ diɔ̱k jek cikɛ li̱w pääm Gil-bwä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wi̱cdɛ ŋok, kä cua giw giwdɛ ka̱n, kä cua naath jäk kä rɛy cieŋ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt diaal, nöŋkɛ ŋɛc thuk kuthkiɛn kɛnɛ naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛ giw giwdɛ la̱th duëël kuɔth Ac-ta-roth. Kä cukɛ puɔ̱ny Thɔɔl la̱th pääny Beth-can. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ Ya-bec-gil-yad min ca lät kä Thɔɔl ɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt liŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu wutni ko̱o̱r diaal ben jiɛɛn kɛ wäär, cukɛ ri̱ŋ Thɔɔl kɛnɛ ri̱ŋ gankɛ wä ka̱n pääny Beth-can kä cukɛ kɛ ben waŋ kä Ya-bec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ cɔ̱wkiɛn ben kony thaar jiaath kɔat kä Ya-bec, kä cukɛ thɛɛk kɛ ni̱n bärɔw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
